# Pagination
Pagination moves between discrete pages. Bind `page`, set `totalPages`, and use `onpagechange` to fetch or replace data. The current page uses `aria-current="page"`.
<DocsExample title="Pagination" source={source} htmlSource={htmlSource}><Example /></DocsExample>

The HTML element emits `pagechange` with the selected page in `event.detail.page`.
